From 9b519649fc7a717ac8fa51f128639116b60557bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZEGEIZI <ZEGEIZI@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:17:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: port Erhai 0.10.2 charging control to Linux
 7.3

Import the published SUPERVOOC, UFCS and PPS controller at dc8c28c12761, including adapter arbitration, dual-pump protection, stock temperature/voltage curves, high-SOC entry, buck FFC/full/recharge and fixed PD/QC fallback. Export charge_contract for the desktop and retain wired charging wake ownership until unplug, including while full.

Use the 7.3 allocation API and existing pmk8550_adc node. Add the stock PMIH010x connector NTC channels and keep all unrelated board settings, including the 1.896 V XN242 constraint.

Source: https://github.com/yzddmr6/linux-sm8750-erhai/tree/dc8c28c12761bcc3a9b320931d6d12476ae91192/drivers/power/supply

Original file-level Oplus, Qualcomm and port authorship/license notices are retained. Source attribution and original per-file history are recorded by the independent patchset release provenance.

Assisted-by: Codex: GPT-6
