+/* Like oplus_chg_pps.c:2043, admit the complete regulation range, not
+ * just the first request. Our pump floor is 2 * vbat_uv_thr_mv + 100 mV;
+ * the firmware-compatible 8.4 V first write is inside that same APDO.
